pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unobtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Saw</b> is an admin tool obtainable only by using a Spawn Menu. Like the name implies, it's a tool used for ease of testing for tree sawing. It has maxed out stats, capable of instantly processing a full tree, having no charge and 50 studs of range.\n</p><p>Saws are tools used to cut off the bark of trees, increasing their price. Essentially, <b>Admin Saw</b> is a better handheld version of a <b>Sander.</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Admin Saw</b>, like any other admin items, uses the same color pallete as them. Blade is colored pink with legacy foil material applied to it. The handle is colored white with legacy wood material applied to it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9231a6f8d8a1540de7ffa6abe0c9b9c2\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Admin_Saw_GC-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:121px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Admin_Saw_GC.png\" title=\"Admin Saw GC.png (81 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:121px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Admin_Saw_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/122?cb=20230719150153\" title=\"Admin Saw GC.png (81 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Admin Saw GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Saw_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Admin Saw GC.png (81 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Admin Saw GC.png\" data-image-key=\"Admin_Saw_GC.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Admin_Saw_GC.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/122?cb=20230719150153\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:117px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:AdminSaw3rdTexture.png\" title=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png (114 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:117px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/AdminSaw3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/117?cb=20230719145541\" title=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png (114 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png\" data-image-key=\"AdminSaw3rdTexture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/AdminSaw3rdTexture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/117?cb=20230719145541\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Early version of <b>Admin Saw</b> used to have a decal of the internet meme \"Giga Chad\" plastered over it's headpiece. DevShurikeno used to have a special variant of the Admin Axe, with a decal of...Twitch streamer XQC morphed into a Pepe the frog holding a pink heart plastered over it's headpiece.</li>\n<li>Current design of <b>Admin Saw</b> uses the design first introduced in older Oaklands iteration - Oaklands Legacy.</li>\n<li>When first added, the saws all had the same stats, including <b>Admin Saw</b>, which made it rather useless. It can be seen in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzDP_6s95GQ\">First Oaklands Trailer</a>.</li>\n<li>The stats for <b>Admin Saw</b>, like <b>Admin Pickaxe</b>, are not representitive of it's actual power.</li>\n<li>The admin saw as well as other admin tools are publicly usable in \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/14171339725/Oaklands-100-Players\">Oaklands 100 Players</a>\", however this game is rarely unlocked by the developers.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902174235\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 93/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 504/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 85/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2708/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.